+# Phase 10 Final Report ΓÇö Support & Service Operations
+
+**Decision:** **READY_FOR_PHASE_11_WITH_BLOCKERS**
+
+**Date:** 2026-07-30
+
+**Working tree:** Phase 10 Waves 0ΓÇô4 delivered in-place on branch `v2` (no git commit required for Wave 4 exit).
+
+Support Ops is shippable for authorised System Admin users as a **dedicated SupportTicket plane** (Γëá CsCase Γëá Platform Incident Γëá CRM Lead): ticket model + numbering + state machine, public/internal/restricted messages, private attachments with scan states, queues/assignment stubs, versioned SLA clocks, My Work / list / detail UI, link-only handoffs, light reconciliation, JSON/CSV export foundation, and explicit KB/Problem/CSAT/Automation contracts. Email / WhatsApp / portal inbound, full KB, live CSAT, AI replies, and Android remain deferred blockers ΓÇö never fabricated.
+
+## Delivered
+
+| Wave | Focus | Status |
+|------|-------|--------|
+| 0 | Forensic audits + matrices + CONDITIONAL GO | Done |
+| 1 | Ticket model + SUP numbering + state machine + admin create | Done |
+| 2 | Messages + attachments + queues/assignment | Done |
+| 3 | SLA clocks + My Work / list / detail UI | Done |
+| 4 | Handoffs + recon/export + foundations + Phase 11 pack | Done |
+
+## Surfaces (Wave 4)
+
+### Libraries
+
+- `lib/admin/support/handoffs.js` ΓÇö link-only CS / Product / Finance / Billing / MRA handoffs; payload sanitisation; no CsCase / subscription / GL / MRA mutation
+- `lib/admin/support/reconciliation.js` ΓÇö ticket vs status history / messages / SLA clocks; gate states; never false zeroes
+- `lib/admin/support/export.js` ΓÇö JSON/CSV tickets; `systemAdmin.support.export` rechecked at download; empty Γëá invent rows
+- `lib/admin/support/foundations.js` ΓÇö KB / Problem / CSAT / Automation contracts (`NOT_AVAILABLE` / `FOUNDATION`); CSAT `score` always null
+
+### Prisma / SQL
+
+- `SupportHandoff`, `SupportReconciliationRun`, `SupportExportAudit`
+- Fallback: `scripts/sql/support-ops-phase10-wave4.sql`
+
+### APIs
+
+- `GET|POST /api/admin/support/tickets/[id]/handoffs`
+- `GET /api/admin/support/handoffs` (list UI)
+- `GET|POST /api/admin/support/reconciliation`
+- `GET /api/admin/support/export?dataset=tickets&format=json|csv`
+- `GET /api/admin/support/foundations`
+
+### UI
+
+- `/insightbooks/support/handoffs`, `/reports`, `/foundations` (thin stubs matching CS foundations pattern)
+- Section nav + i18n (en/ny)
+
+## Hard rules preserved
+
+- Support Ticket Γëá CsCase Γëá Platform Incident Γëá CRM Lead
+- Public / internal / restricted notes API-enforced
+- No billing / MRA fiscal / Tenant GL mutation from Support (handoffs are link-only)
+- SLA deterministic; acknowledgement Γëá human first response by default
+- No fabricated tickets / CSAT scores; no false zeroes; no AI replies
+- Email / WhatsApp / portal remain `NOT_AVAILABLE` channel contracts
+- System CoA admin route stays removed
+
+## Verification
+
+```bash
+npx vitest run \
+  test/systemAdmin.support.handoffs.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.support.reconciliation.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.support.sla.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.support.tickets.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.support.messages.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.support.assignment.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.supportAccess.test.js \
+  test/systemAdmin.navPermissionMap.test.js
+```
+
+**Result (2026-07-30):** Test Files 8 passed (8) ┬╖ Tests 66 passed (66)
+
+## Known blockers for Phase 11
+
+1. **Email-to-ticket ingest** ΓÇö channel contract `NOT_AVAILABLE` (no invented inbound volume)
+2. **WhatsApp channel** ΓÇö deferred; same honesty gate
+3. **Customer portal** ΓÇö deferred; `projectForCustomer` helper exists but portal UX not shipped
+4. **Full Knowledge Base** ΓÇö foundation contract only (`NOT_AVAILABLE`)
+5. **Live CSAT / satisfaction** ΓÇö `NOT_AVAILABLE`; score always null
+6. **Problem Management depth** ΓÇö `FOUNDATION` only; no fake problem KPIs
+7. **Automation / AI replies / auto-routing** ΓÇö deferred
+8. **Android support plane** ΓÇö not instrumented
+9. **Export** ΓÇö JSON/CSV foundation only; XLSX/PDF not offered
+10. **Queue live staffing metrics** ΓÇö catalogue `liveStatus: NOT_FOUND` until real org owners exist
+
+## Exit readiness
+
+**READY_FOR_PHASE_11_WITH_BLOCKERS** ΓÇö Support Ops Waves 1ΓÇô4 are honest and gated for admin-manual tickets, messaging, SLA, link-only handoffs, recon, and export foundations; portal/email/WhatsApp/full KB/CSAT/Android remain blockers for treating Support as omnichannel-complete.
